{"page":378,"verses":[{"verse_key":"27:14","surah":27,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَحَدُوا۟ بِهَا وَٱسْتَيْقَنَتْهَآ أَنفُسُهُمْ ظُلْمًا وَعُلُوًّا ۚ فَٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They denied them, in their wickedness and their pride, even though their souls acknowledged them as true. See how those who spread corruption met their end!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَحَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they rejected","transliteration":"wajaḥadū","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱسْتَيْقَنَتْهَآ","en_gloss":"though were convinced with them (signs)","transliteration":"wa-is'tayqanathā","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنفُسُهُمْ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusuhum","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظُلْمًۭا","en_gloss":"(out of) injustice","transliteration":"ẓul'man","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعُلُوًّۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"and haughtiness","transliteration":"waʿuluwwan","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَٱنظُرْ","en_gloss":"So see","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the corrupters","transliteration":"l-muf'sidīna","verse_key":"27:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:14"}]},{"verse_key":"27:15","surah":27,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا دَاوُۥدَ وَسُلَيْمَـٰنَ عِلْمًا ۖ وَقَالَا ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِى فَضَّلَنَا عَلَىٰ كَثِيرٍ مِّنْ عِبَادِهِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave knowledge to David and Solomon, and they both said, ‘Praise be to God, who has favoured us over many of His believing servants.’","word